=========================================
ALLOCATE PAYMENT
=========================================

Input

paymentId

AllocatePaymentRequest

Business Rules

Load payment.

Payment must exist.

Payment cannot be Draft.

Payment cannot be Refunded.

Payment cannot be Cancelled.

Load invoices.

Each invoice

must exist

must belong to the payment customer

must not be void

must not be fully paid

Allocation amount

must be greater than zero

must not exceed invoice outstanding balance

Total allocation

must never exceed payment amount

Create PaymentAllocationEntity rows.

=========================================
UPDATE PAYMENT TOTALS
=========================================

After allocation

calculate

allocatedAmount

unallocatedAmount

fullyAllocated

Rules

allocatedAmount

=

sum(all allocations)

-----------------------------------------

unallocatedAmount

=

amountReceived - allocatedAmount

-----------------------------------------

fullyAllocated

=

allocatedAmount.compareTo(amountReceived) == 0

